---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Utah Oasis Homes"
  description="Learn how Utah Oasis Homes collects, uses, protects, and shares information submitted through this website."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <section class="privacy-page" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <header class="privacy-header">
      <div class="pill-eyebrow">Your information matters</div>

      <h1 id="privacy-title" class="privacy-title">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="privacy-updated">
        Last updated: July 13, 2026
      </p>

      <p class="privacy-intro">
        Utah Oasis Homes respects your privacy. This policy explains what
        information we collect through this website, how we use it, and the
        choices available to you.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="privacy-content">
      <section aria-labelledby="information-we-collect">
        <h2 id="information-we-collect">
          Information We Collect
        </h2>

        <p>
          We may collect information that you voluntarily provide through our
          consultation form or by contacting us directly. This may include:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your email address</li>
          <li>Your telephone number</li>
          <li>Your preferred method of contact</li>
          <li>Your desired build location</li>
          <li>Your project type, budget range, and approximate timeline</li>
          <li>
            Details you choose to share about your property, home plans, and
            project vision
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Our website and service providers may also collect limited technical
          information automatically, such as your browser type, device type,
          IP address, referring page, and the date and time of your visit or
          form submission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="how-we-use-information">
        <h2 id="how-we-use-information">
          How We Use Your Information
        </h2>

        <p>
          We use the information we collect to:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your questions and consultation request</li>
          <li>Contact you by phone, text message, or email</li>
          <li>Learn about your project and determine how we may assist you</li>
          <li>Maintain records of inquiries and communications</li>
          <li>Protect the website and reduce fraudulent or unwanted submissions</li>
          <li>Improve our website, services, and customer experience</li>
          <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          We do not use information submitted through the consultation form to
          send unrelated marketing messages without your permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="form-processing">
        <h2 id="form-processing">
          Form Processing and Service Providers
        </h2>

        <p>
          Our consultation form is processed through Formspree, a third-party
          form-submission service. Information submitted through the form is
          transmitted to and temporarily stored by Formspree so that it can be
          delivered to Utah Oasis Homes, filtered for spam, and made available
          in our Formspree account.
        </p>

        <p>
          We may also use website hosting, email, security, analytics, and other
          technology providers that process limited information on our behalf.
          These providers may access information only as reasonably necessary
          to perform their services or comply with legal requirements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="sharing-information">
        <h2 id="sharing-information">
          How We Share Information
        </h2>

        <p>
          We do not sell or rent personal information submitted through this
          website.
        </p>

        <p>
          We may share information:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>
            With service providers that help us operate the website and respond
            to inquiries
          </li>
          <li>
            With professional advisers, contractors, or business partners when
            reasonably necessary to evaluate or support your requested project
          </li>
          <li>
            When required by law, legal process, court order, or governmental
            request
          </li>
          <li>
            When reasonably necessary to protect our rights, property, users,
            business, or the safety of others
          </li>
          <li>
            In connection with a merger, sale, reorganization, or transfer of
            all or part of the business
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="cookies-analytics">
        <h2 id="cookies-analytics">
          Cookies and Analytics
        </h2>

        <p>
          This website may use essential browser technologies needed for basic
          site operation and security. We may also add website analytics in the
          future to understand general traffic patterns and improve the site.
        </p>

        <p>
          If analytics or advertising technologies are added, we will update
          this policy as appropriate. You can control many cookies through your
          browser settings, although disabling certain technologies may affect
          how some website features function.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="data-retention">
        <h2 id="data-retention">
          Data Retention
        </h2>

        <p>
          We retain inquiry information for as long as reasonably necessary to
          respond to you, evaluate or perform requested services, maintain
          appropriate business records, resolve disputes, enforce agreements,
          and comply with legal obligations.
        </p>

        <p>
          Information may remain in ordinary backups or service-provider
          systems for a limited period after it is deleted from active records.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="information-security">
        <h2 id="information-security">
          Information Security
        </h2>

        <p>
          We use reasonable administrative and technical measures intended to
          protect the information submitted through this website. However, no
          method of transmission or electronic storage is completely secure,
          and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="your-choices">
        <h2 id="your-choices">
          Your Choices
        </h2>

        <p>
          You may contact us to:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Ask what information we maintain about you</li>
          <li>Request that inaccurate information be corrected</li>
          <li>Request deletion of information, subject to applicable exceptions</li>
          <li>Ask us to stop contacting you</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          We may need to verify your identity before completing certain
          requests.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="children">
        <h2 id="children">
          Children’s Privacy
        </h2>

        <p>
          This website is intended for adults interested in residential design
          and construction services. We do not knowingly collect personal
          information from children under 13. If we learn that such information
          has been submitted, we will take reasonable steps to delete it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="external-links">
        <h2 id="external-links">
          Links to Other Websites
        </h2>

        <p>
          This website may contain links to websites operated by other
          organizations. We are not responsible for the privacy practices,
          content, or security of those external websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="policy-changes">
        <h2 id="policy-changes">
          Changes to This Policy
        </h2>

        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we
          will revise the “Last updated” date at the top of this page. Material
          changes may also be communicated through the website or by another
          reasonable method.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="contact-us">
        <h2 id="contact-us">
          Contact Us
        </h2>

        <p>
          Questions or requests concerning this Privacy Policy may be directed
          to:
        </p>

        <address class="privacy-contact">
          <strong>Utah Oasis Homes</strong><br />
          2052 West 700 South, Unit H<br />
          Springville, UT 84664<br />
          Phone:
          <a href="tel:+18018593317">
            (801) 859-3317
          </a><br />
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:utahoasishomes@gmail.com">
            utahoasishomes@gmail.com
          </a>
        </address>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>